# oracle: YAFF MOF-5 example, bonded terms only (bond mm3, angle hybrid cross mm3, dihedral fourier, improper distharm), pair zero: the example's mm3 pair is not in the engine yet. NPT as in the example, 50 steps.
# measured 2026-10-13 (engine vs native, max relative error per value, no absolute floor): thermo 1.7e-13, per-atom 4.2e-8; the compare passes at rel 1e-8 abs 1e-10.
# oracle-inputs: w118yaff_mof5_nopair.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p
dielectric      1
special_bonds   lj 0.000000 0.000000 1.000000 coul 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
pair_style      zero 12.0
bond_style      mm3
angle_style     hybrid cross mm3
dihedral_style  fourier
improper_style  distharm
read_data       w118yaff_mof5_nopair.data
pair_coeff      * *
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 2 delay 4 check yes
timestep        0.5
velocity        all create 0.0 5
fix             1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0 tri 1.0 1.0 1000.0 tchain 3 mtk yes nreset 1000
thermo_style    custom step etotal ke temp pe emol evdwl vol press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g norm no
thermo          10
run             50
